<end>

<keyword> CMD FWRITEREC

      .--------------------------------------------------------------.
      |                           <clr=52>FWRITEREC                          <clr=48>|
      `--------------------------------------------------------------'

       <clr=49>Syntax:<clr=48>
       <clr=49>Description:<clr=48>
