<keyword> CMD HALT

      .--------------------------------------------------------------.
      |                         <clr=52>HALT                                 <clr=48>|
      `--------------------------------------------------------------'

       <clr=49>Syntax:<clr=48>

          Procedure HALT

       <clr=49>Description:<clr=48>

          Halts execution of the program and returns the user immediately
          back to the BBS.

       <clr=49>Example:<clr=48>

          If Graphics = 0 Then
            WriteLn ('Sorry, this program requires ANSI graphics.')
            Halt
          EndIf

