<keyword> CMD SYSOPLOG

      .--------------------------------------------------------------.
      |                         <clr=52>SYSOPLOG                             <clr=48>|
      `--------------------------------------------------------------'

       <clr=49>Syntax:<clr=48>

          Procedure SysopLog (Text String)

       <clr=49>Description:<clr=48>

          This procedure adds a line of text to the current node's Sysop log
          file.  The date and time will automatically be added into the log
          as well, keeping the same format as all the other entries into the
          log.

       <clr=49>Example:<clr=48>

          SysopLog ('This will be in the log file now!')

